"Specification" means the public normative and explanatory protocol materials in docs/, schemas/, openapi/, protocol diagrams, public message definitions, test vectors expressly designated as specification material, and equivalent public protocol documentation.

"Reference Code" means executable or buildable source code, tests, SDK/reference implementation code, scripts, CI/configuration and related implementation material, including src/ and tests/, unless a file states otherwise.

